FinTrack — Progress Checkpoint

You're right: we're probably well under 5% complete in terms of the actual application. That's fine. The important thing is that the foundation isn't being improvised as we go.

1. What FinTrack is

FinTrack is a portfolio-focused personal finance application.

Its purpose is to demonstrate that you can build a serious Flutter application involving:

Flutter/Dart
Riverpod
Local persistence
SQLite/Drift
CRUD
relational data
business logic
search/filtering
charts
navigation
validation
professional UI/UX
error/loading/empty states

It is not intended to become a fintech product or startup.

That's an important constraint we'll keep enforcing.

