3. Architecture decision

We've settled on:

Feature-first
+
lightweight shared core
+
repository pattern
+
Riverpod
+
Drift

The overall data flow is:

                 ┌──────────────┐
                 │     UI       │
                 └──────┬───────┘
                        ↓
                 ┌──────────────┐
                 │   Riverpod   │
                 └──────┬───────┘
                        ↓
                 ┌──────────────┐
                 │ Repository   │
                 └──────┬───────┘
                        ↓
                 ┌──────────────┐
                 │    Drift     │
                 └──────┬───────┘
                        ↓
                 ┌──────────────┐
                 │   SQLite     │
                 └──────────────┘

The database is the source of truth.

That's probably the single most important architectural principle we'll maintain throughout the project.

